{{root|en|ine-pro|*weyk-|id=contain}}
From {{der|en|la|Victōria}}, from {{m|la|victōria||victory}}. {{doublet|en|Vitória}}. The given name can also be analyzed as the male name {{suffix|en|Victor|ia}}. {{cln|en|eponyms}} The places were named in honour of {{w|lang=en|Queen Victoria}} of Great Britain.

